sieve-filter-v2
; How much silence: at most `run` rests in a row and `total` in a track, and, unless `leading`
; allows it, no rest before the first note. The state is the rests so far and the rests in a row
; (state 0: nothing yet; then 1 + total_so_far * (run + 1) + in_a_row).
id        melody-rests
version   1
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     audio
symbols   notes*
describe  At most so many rests in a row and in all, and none first unless allowed.
param     run      int     2  0  16  the most rests in a row
param     total    int     8  0  64  the most rests in a track
param     leading  choice  no no,yes whether a track may begin with a rest

states    {1 + (total + 1) * (run + 1)}
start     0
accept    0..{(total + 1) * (run + 1)}
for d 0 {DURATIONS - 1}
  for p 1 {PITCHES}
    t 0 @{p * DURATIONS + d} 1
    for so_far 0 {total}
      for row 0 {run}
        t {1 + so_far * (run + 1) + row} @{p * DURATIONS + d} {1 + so_far * (run + 1)}
      done
    done
  done
  if {leading == 1 && run >= 1 && total >= 1}
    t 0 @{d} {1 + (run + 1) + 1}
  fi
  for so_far 0 {total - 1}
    for row 0 {run - 1}
      t {1 + so_far * (run + 1) + row} @{d} {1 + (so_far + 1) * (run + 1) + row + 1}
    done
  done
done
end
